About Us: restored original image, two-column layout, and card-free
text structure, then applied only the new heading ("From Creative
Ideas to Intelligent Solutions"), the AI-touched paragraph, and
removal of the stats row. Original heading/paragraph typography and
sizing preserved exactly.

Why Choose Us: Point 01 and Point 03 descriptions updated to the new
wording. Titles, icons, colors, numbering, layout, and Point 02 are
all untouched.
